# Vertical slices

```text
Application/<Module>/<Feature>/<Action>/
  <Action>Command.cs | Handler.cs | Validator.cs | Result.cs
Api/<Module>/<Feature>/<Action>/
  <Action>Endpoint.cs | Request.cs | Response.cs
```

- One handler per command/query.
- Expected business failures → explicit Result; not exceptions.
- No nested types in endpoint/handler files.
- Queries: purpose-specific ports (e.g. `IClaimReviewQueueQuery`), not aggregates for lists.
- Long work → 202 OperationAccepted; UI observes status URL.
